        "statement": "<p>Cloth that <em>softens</em> with every wearing, cut for the hours between noon and dusk.</p>",
        "details": "<p>Every piece begins as a sketch on cotton rag paper, hand-painted by one of a small circle of Colombo artists, then cut and sewn a few streets away. Nothing is printed, nothing is mass-produced — what you see on the model is the one original, repeated only a dozen or so times.</p>",
