      "settings": {
        "number": "06.",
        "heading": "Atelier",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/liya-04.png",
        "tone": 2,
        "title": "<p>A house built for <em>warm weather</em>.</p>",
        "body": "<p>We began with one shop in Colombo and a narrow idea: clothes for a climate that asks for very little. Everything is made close to home, in small batches, from cloth that behaves better the longer you keep it.</p>",
        "body_2": "<p>Every dress passes through the same three hands: a painter, a cutter, a finisher — all working a short walk from each other. We'd rather make fewer pieces well than many pieces quickly, so a run rarely goes past twenty.</p>",
        "cta_text": "Who we are",
        "cta_url": "#shopify-section-film"
      }
    },
