        "number": "07.",
        "label": "Verande Film",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/amala-02.png",
        "title": "<p>A house of <em>light</em></p>",
        "body": "<p>Shot over one afternoon on a veranda outside Colombo. Cloth moving in the heat, the way it actually falls — no styling, no straightening, nothing pressed.</p>",
        "body_2": "<p>No two runs are painted quite the same — a slower way to dress, in a climate that rewards slowing down.</p>",
